    "Let Vigil read %@ so it can see that agent work.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Erlaube Vigil, %@ zu lesen, damit es erkennt, wann dein Agent arbeitet."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allow Vigil to read %@ so it can tell when your agent is working."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Permite que Vigil lea %@ para saber cuándo está trabajando tu agente."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Autorisez Vigil à lire %@ pour savoir quand votre agent travaille."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Consenti a Vigil di leggere %@ per sapere quando il tuo agente sta lavorando."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Разрешите Vigil читать %@, чтобы понимать, когда работает агент."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let Vigil read your ~/.claude folder so it can tell when Claude Code is working.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Erlaube den Zugriff auf ~/.claude, damit Vigil erkennt, wann Claude Code arbeitet."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allow access to ~/.claude so Vigil can tell when Claude Code is working."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Permite acceso a ~/.claude para que Vigil sepa cuándo trabaja Claude Code."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Autorisez l'accès à ~/.claude pour que Vigil sache quand Claude Code travaille."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Consenti accesso a ~/.claude perché Vigil sappia quando Claude Code sta lavorando."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Разрешите доступ к ~/.claude, чтобы Vigil понимал, когда работает Claude Code."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets Claude Code tell Vigil exactly when it starts and stops, instead of Vigil inferring it from files. This is also what makes \"an agent is waiting for you\" reliable.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code teilt Vigil genau mit, wann Arbeit beginnt und endet. So funktionieren auch Hinweise wie „Wartet auf dich“ zuverlässig."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lets Claude Code tell Vigil exactly when work starts and stops. It also makes \"waiting for you\" notifications reliable."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Permite que Claude Code le indique a Vigil exactamente cuándo empieza y termina el trabajo. También hace fiables los avisos de «un agente te espera»."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Permet à Claude Code d'indiquer précisément à Vigil quand le travail commence et se termine. Cela rend aussi fiables les notifications « un agent vous attend »."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Permette a Claude Code di dire a Vigil esattamente quando il lavoro inizia e finisce. Rende affidabili anche le notifiche «un agente ti aspetta»."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code сможет точно сообщать Vigil, когда работа начинается и заканчивается. Благодаря этому уведомления «Агент ждёт вас» будут надёжными."
          }
        }
      }
    },
