        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Выключен"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off by default. Vigil keeps the Mac running while your agent works; letting the screen sleep saves real power and changes nothing else.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn der Bildschirm schläft, sparst du Energie, ohne deinen Agenten zu unterbrechen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Letting the display sleep saves power and won't interrupt your agent."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dejar que la pantalla se apague ahorra energía y no interrumpe al agente."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Laisser l'écran s'éteindre économise de l'énergie sans interrompre votre agent."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lasciare spegnere lo schermo fa risparmiare energia e non interrompe il tuo agente."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Если экран погаснет, агент продолжит работу, а Mac будет расходовать меньше энергии."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once a day, Vigil asks GitHub whether a newer version exists. That is the only time Vigil uses the network, it sends nothing about you, and it never installs anything on its own.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vigil prüft einmal täglich auf GitHub, ob eine neue Version verfügbar ist. Das ist seine einzige Netzwerkanfrage. Es sendet keine persönlichen Daten und installiert Updates nie automatisch."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vigil checks GitHub once a day for a newer version. This is its only network request. It sends no personal data and never installs updates automatically."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vigil consulta GitHub una vez al día para buscar una versión nueva. Es su única solicitud de red. No envía datos personales ni instala actualizaciones automáticamente."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vigil consulte GitHub une fois par jour pour chercher une nouvelle version. C'est sa seule requête réseau. Aucune donnée personnelle n'est envoyée et les mises à jour ne sont jamais installées automatiquement."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vigil controlla GitHub una volta al giorno per cercare una nuova versione. È la sua unica richiesta di rete. Non invia dati personali e non installa mai gli aggiornamenti automaticamente."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Раз в день Vigil проверяет на GitHub, не вышла ли новая версия. Это его единственный сетевой запрос. Личные данные не отправляются, обновления никогда не устанавливаются автоматически."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once Vigil has held your Mac awake through an agent run, this is where you will see what that was worth: how long it kept working while you were away, and how many runs would otherwise have died when the Mac went to sleep.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Statistiken erscheinen, nachdem Vigil deinen Mac während eines Agentenlaufs wach gehalten hat."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stats appear after Vigil keeps your Mac awake through an agent run."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las estadísticas aparecerán después de que Vigil mantenga el Mac despierto durante una ejecución."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les statistiques apparaîtront après que Vigil aura gardé votre Mac éveillé pendant une exécution."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le statistiche appariranno dopo che Vigil avrà tenuto sveglio il Mac durante un'esecuzione."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Статистика появится после того, как Vigil хотя бы раз не даст Mac уснуть во время работы агента."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only for runs longer than %@.": {
